{
  "features": [
    {
      "id": "connection",
      "name": "接続先と API キー",
      "entryPoints": [
        "redmine-clientActivityDashboard",
        "redmine-client.setApiKey",
        "redmine-client.clearApiKey",
        "redmine-client.showApiKeyStatus",
        "redmine-client.assignEditorToCurrentConnection"
      ],
      "selectors": [
        "#tab-settings",
        "#set-apikey-btn",
        "#clear-api-key-btn"
      ],
      "invariants": [
        "API キーは正規化された connectionScope ごとに SecretStorage へ保存する。",
        "ループバック以外の HTTP 接続には認証情報を送らない。"
      ],
      "checks": [
        "src/test/connectionScope.test.ts",
        "src/test/dashboardConnectionReset.test.ts",
        "src/test/live/dashboardWorkflow.test.ts"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ticket-browsing",
      "name": "プロジェクト選択とチケット検索",
      "entryPoints": [
        "redmine-clientActivityDashboard",
        "redmine-client.selectProject",
        "redmine-client.toggleChildProjects",
        "redmine-client.searchTickets",
        "redmine-client.refreshTickets",
        "redmine-client.toggleCompactMode"
      ],
      "selectors": [
        "#project-select-trigger",
        "#tab-tickets",
        "#search-input",
        "#detail-focus-toggle",
        "#advanced-filter-dialog",
        ".ticket-row[data-id]",
        "#tab-settings",
        "#set-sort-field",
        "#set-sort-dir"
      ],
      "invariants": [
        "プロジェクト選択と子プロジェクトの設定に従ってチケットを表示する。",
        "検索コマンドは Dashboard の Tickets タブを開き、既存の検索条件を保持して検索欄にフォーカスする。詳細フォーカスで検索欄が隠れていれば設定を解除して保存する。",
        "Dashboard の操作メッセージは検証してから処理する。",
        "期日と開始日の並び替えは取得済みチケットに適用し、階層と検索の直接一致優先を維持する。"
      ],
      "checks": [
        "src/test/dashboardProjectSelection.test.ts",
        "src/test/dashboardMessageValidation.test.ts",
        "src/test/ticketsSettingsSorting.test.ts",
        "src/test/dashboardTicketSearch.test.ts",
        "src/test/dashboardSearchFocus.test.ts",
        "src/test/ticketListSettingsStore.test.ts",
        "src/test/dashboardValidationExtended.test.ts",
        "src/test/createdTicketListSelection.test.ts",
        "scripts/check-dashboard-ui.cjs",
        "src/test/live/dashboardWorkflow.test.ts"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ticket-editing",
      "name": "チケット作成と Markdown 編集",
      "entryPoints": [
        "redmine-clientActivityDashboard",
        "redmine-client.createTicket",
        "redmine-client.createTicketFromDashboard",
        "redmine-client.createTicketFromMarkdownHeader",
        "redmine-client.createTicketFromList",
        "redmine-client.createChildTicketFromList",
        "redmine-client.openTicketPreview",
        "redmine-client.syncOpenEditor",
        "redmine-client.editFieldViaQuickPick",
        "redmine-client.openInBrowser"
      ],
      "selectors": [
        "#ticket-detail-card",
        ".ticket-hover-actions",
        "[data-ticket-action=\"sync\"]",
        "[data-ticket-action=\"browser\"]",
        "#detail-cancel-btn"
      ],
      "invariants": [
        "作成時は Markdown の見出しとメタデータをチケットの入力に反映する。",
        "下書きは接続先ごとに分離する。",
        "ブラウザで開くコマンドは明示された文書、アクティブな Redmine エディター、Dashboard の選択の順に対象を判定する。"
      ],
      "checks": [
        "src/test/createTicketFromMarkdownHeader.test.ts",
        "src/test/openInBrowserActions.test.ts",
        "src/test/openInBrowserCommands.test.ts",
        "src/test/openInBrowserIntegration.test.ts",
        "src/test/markdownTicketCreateService.test.ts",
        "src/test/draftPersistenceScope.test.ts",
        "src/test/createdTicketListSelection.test.ts",
        "src/test/live/dashboardWorkflow.test.ts",
        "src/test/live/editorWorkflowSync.test.ts"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "comments",
      "name": "コメントの閲覧・追加・編集",
      "entryPoints": [
        "redmine-clientActivityDashboard",
        "redmine-client.refreshComments",
        "redmine-client.addCommentFromComments",
        "redmine-client.editComment",
        "redmine-client.openInBrowser"
      ],
      "selectors": [
        "#comments-list",
        "#detail-comment-count",
        "#add-comment-btn",
        "#reload-comments-btn",
        "[data-comment-action=\"browser\"]"
      ],
      "invariants": [
        "選択チケットのコメントを表示する。",
        "編集権限のないコメントの更新を拒否する。",
        "既存コメントのブラウザ URL は Redmine の注記番号を使う。",
        "新規コメントは空の本文欄で開き、本文先頭に入力した Markdown 見出しを同期する。"
      ],
      "checks": [
        "src/test/commentListMapping.test.ts",
        "src/test/openInBrowserCommands.test.ts",
        "src/test/openInBrowserIntegration.test.ts",
        "src/test/commentPermissions.test.ts",
        "src/test/commentCreateTemplate.test.ts",
        "src/test/commentSaveSync.test.ts",
        "src/test/stabilizeDashboard013SaveSerialization.test.ts",
        "src/test/live/isolationSync.test.ts",
        "src/test/live/dashboardWorkflow.test.ts"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "offline-sync",
      "name": "未同期の変更と同期の復旧",
      "entryPoints": [
        "redmine-clientActivityDashboard",
        "redmine-client.runOfflineSync",
        "redmine-client.syncUnsyncedFile",
        "redmine-client.configureOfflineSyncMode",
        "redmine-client.syncAllOpenEditors"
      ],
      "selectors": [
        "#tab-unsynced",
        "#unsynced-list",
        "#sync-all-btn"
      ],
      "invariants": [
        "リモート書き込み後に再取得・照合してからローカル状態を確定する。",
        "commit_unknown の操作は自動再試行しない。",
        "旧 revision または attemptGeneration の処理による保存を拒否する。",
        "新規チケットは auto で保存時に作成し、manual はローカル保存する。作成が 403 の場合は明示的な再同期のみ許可する。",
        "Dashboard の一括同期では新規チケットのステータス一覧取得または作成の HTTP エラーを操作名とコードで表示する。"
      ],
      "checks": [
        "src/test/dashboardSyncTray.test.ts",
        "src/test/dashboardSyncFeedback.test.ts",
        "src/test/saveSyncExecutorAutoMode.test.ts",
        "src/test/ticketSyncService.test.ts",
        "src/test/syncLifecycleBoundary.test.ts",
        "src/test/syncLifecycleOwnership.test.ts",
        "src/test/createdTicketListSelection.test.ts"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "editor-defaults",
      "name": "エディターの既定値",
      "entryPoints": [
        "redmine-clientActivityDashboard",
        "redmine-client.configureEditorDefaultSubject",
        "redmine-client.configureEditorDefaultDescription",
        "redmine-client.configureEditorDefaultTracker",
        "redmine-client.configureEditorDefaultPriority",
        "redmine-client.configureEditorDefaultStatus",
        "redmine-client.configureEditorDefaultDueDate",
        "redmine-client.resetEditorDefaults"
      ],
      "selectors": [
        "#tab-settings",
        "#set-editor-subject",
        "#reset-editor-defaults-btn"
      ],
      "invariants": [
        "設定した既定値を新規チケットの入力に適用できる。"
      ],
      "checks": [
        "src/test/dashboardSettingsState.test.ts",
        "src/test/live/dashboardWorkflow.test.ts",
        "src/test/live/editorWorkflowSync.test.ts"
      ]
    }
  ],
